    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38afacb79112eb761349c280",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁称霸德比，达成二冠。\n在世人为此兴奋不已时，琵琶晨光召开了\n“宝冢纪念”的参赛记者会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bce23a74ed30c0fcdd40316c00a9f2d928d82c527964488fe52c787479189e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
