    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8433a5dac02bb06f7b50f63a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这天是“天皇赏（秋）”的最后调整日，\n之后还有与成田白仁对决的舞台──\n“有马纪念”在等着……",
      "source_fingerprint": "afcec6e1042c4dd4f01fc0ec49ac1b45a6bb6770250d400628bf52593d99d96e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1023/storytimeline_501023405.json",
      "json_path": [
