    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0e89eb2bdbaabaa34dddc8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这时琵琶晨光回到训练员身边，\n发现训练员一个人在勉强自己，\n于是相当生气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59091f6d76c551d6e7a9cbdef5e3ad2c54a9fb05867afaf6cc0ae7b64b0756e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
