    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fba5ff572affb748a460ad46",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是其中一方倒下，梦想就结束了。\n琵琶晨光眼眶含泪地诉说着。\n训练员因此改变主意，决定早点休息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "049d79746b59d494eadd3ca923e2e44067c795607690c26af24a866ba18f220d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
