    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c904da1e9d2fe9e99db0e58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们各自为了“菊花赏”燃起斗志，\n劲敌们一起切磋琢磨的夏天到来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73e76a5c2c880d1e5562b369fb72c639350a409e7db408950218d9a89ce64d7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
