    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdfa30376fad59958c079198",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“夏季集训”即将开始。\n为了准备与成田白仁的对决，\n这是进行最后冲刺的重要集训。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0ce0c278083216727f398fd6a93166c002940af08b75a183f7fdaea41550595",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
